Loop -> Loop: invokeModel()\nContext(system, messages, tool schemas)
Loop -> AI: streamSimple(model, context, options)
AI -> Provider: resolve provider "campusmate"\nstreamSimple(...)
Provider -> Provider: MateChatRequestMapper.map()\nmessages + tools + stream options
Provider -> Parser: create parser for this response
Provider -> Mate: POST /mate-service/v1/LLM/chat\nstream=true, include_usage=true
note over AI, Provider
Fallback ApiProvider routing exists.
This diagram follows the default CampusMate model.
end note
loop Response chunks
  Mate -->> Parser: SSE data via WebClient subscription
  Parser -->> Loop: AssistantMessageEventStream\ntext / thinking / tool-call deltas
  Loop -> Projector: MessageUpdateEvent\nvia Agent listener
  Projector -> Projector: best-effort text / thinking preview\nvia RuntimeEventOutput
end
Mate -->> Parser: [DONE]
Parser -> Parser: finalize content and tool arguments\nusage + stop reason
Parser -->> Loop: DoneEvent(AssistantMessage)
Loop -> Loop: append AssistantMessage to context
Loop -> Projector: MessageEndEvent
Projector -> Projector: persist Assistant + usage + public event\nthen emit completed frame
alt ToolCalls present and response not ERROR / ABORTED
  Loop -> Loop: runToolPhase()\nappend tool results; invoke model again
else No ToolCalls or terminal response
  Loop -> Loop: finish / inspect queued controls
end
note over Loop, Projector
ThinkingEnd persists reasoning when enabled; Coordinator finalizes execution.
CampusMate server internals are outside this source scope.
end note
@enduml

