title Mate tools / discovery and execution
autonumber
participant "ToolExecution\nPipeline" as Pipeline
participant "ListMateTools /\nCallMateTool" as Tool
participant "MateToolDiscovery\n+ SessionCache" as Discovery
participant "HttpMateToolClient" as Client
participant "CampusMate" as Mate

opt Model requests ListMateTools
  Pipeline -> Tool: execute({skillName?})
  Tool -> Discovery: listAgentTools() / listSkillTools(name)
  Discovery -> Client: query bound tools for one source
  Client -> Mate: GET Agent or Skill bindings
  Mate --> Client: bound tool IDs
  Client -> Mate: POST /runtime/tools/query\n{"toolIds": [...]}
  Mate --> Client: tool metadata
  Client --> Discovery: ordered metadata
  Discovery -> Discovery: update this source's name-to-id index
  Discovery --> Tool: metadata
  Tool --> Pipeline: scope + name + description + inputSchema
end

Pipeline -> Tool: execute CallMateTool({tool, args?})\nafter Runtime permission hook
Tool -> Tool: require complete execution credentials
Tool -> Discovery: resolveToolId(tool)
alt Name present in Session cache
  Discovery --> Tool: toolId
else Cache miss
  Discovery -> Client: load Agent + ALL directly bound Skills\nunder refresh lock
  Client -> Mate: binding queries + metadata queries
  Mate --> Client: metadata for all sources
  Client --> Discovery: complete source snapshots
  Discovery -> Discovery: reject conflicting names;\npublish complete index atomically
  Discovery --> Tool: toolId or unresolved/error
end
alt Name resolved
  Tool -> Client: callTool(toolId, args, credentials)
  Client -> Mate: POST /runtime/tools/{toolId}/execute\n{"arguments": {...}} + credential headers
  Mate --> Client: ResultBean result
  Client --> Tool: ToolResult(content, metadata, isError)
  Tool --> Pipeline: AgentToolResult or exception
else Unresolved or discovery failed
  Tool --> Pipeline: exception -> error ToolResultMessage
end
note over Client, Mate
Paths in this diagram share prefix /mate-service/v1.
Discovery carries no execution credential headers.
The execution method has no automatic replay loop.
end note
@enduml

